Scene Description in RDF Triples (Turtle Format)
@prefix : <http://cecs571.csulb.edu/ontology/cornercase#> .
@prefix xsd: <http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#> .

:scene1 a :Scene ;
    :scenarioName "FoggyNightParking" ;
    :hasCornerCaseType :cc1 .

:cc1 a :StateAnomaly ;
    :hasWeatherCondition :weather1 ;
    :hasActor :actor1, :actor2 ;
    :hasRisk :risk1 .

:weather1 a :FoggyCondition, :NightCondition .

:actor1 a :Vehicle ;
    :description "Parked vehicle on the side" .

:actor2 a :Vehicle ;
    :description "Black vehicle with open door" .

:risk1 a :OcclusionRisk ;
    :description "Limited visibility due to fog and night, combined with potentially opening vehicle door near traffic" ;
    :hasSeverityScore :sev1 ;
    :confidenceScore "0.75"^^xsd:float .

:sev1 a :SeverityScore ;
    :severityValue "0.65"^^xsd:float .

Identified Risks for each risk class
Risk 1:
Description: Occlusion risk caused by heavy fog and night conditions, exacerbating the danger of parked vehicles (potential open door).
Severity Score: 0.65